# Open 20.1
tags: open, benchmark, 2020
stimulus: Ten short rounds, 180 reps; a sprint that turns into a grind.
note: Any variation of a snatch or clean and jerk counts for the ground-to-overhead. Burpees are bar-facing, over a barbell loaded with 18 in plates.
10 rounds for time, cap 15:00
  8 Ground to overhead 95/65 lb
  10 Burpee over the bar

Scaled:
  Ground to overhead 65/45 lb
